# The enforcement layer IS the gate for agent-authored code, so it is version
# controlled: a hook that only exists on one laptop protects nothing and does
# not survive a clone. Personal config (settings.local.json, local skills)
# stays out.
!.claude/settings.json
!.claude/hooks/
AGENTS.md
.codegraph
# local analysis scratch (not committed)
.scratch/
