graphknows/utils/
# CLAUDE.md is the agent contract (container-not-host, no-silent-fallback, the
# gate layout). Ignoring it is how this repo ended up with a CLAUDE.md
# describing an entirely different project.
.sonar
.mcp.json
docs\agents

graphify-out
CLAUDE.md
